      "review_summary": "The PR replaces the process-local cron deferral set with an optional persisted job-state flag, clears it through maintenance and execution paths, and strips it from public gateway read and mutation responses.\n\nPR surface: Source -6, Tests +119. Total +113 across 11 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main persists the deferred `nextRunAtMs` but reconstructs an empty process-local marker Set in a fresh service, giving a high-confidence second-start path that advances the slot.",
